    "390": {
      "date": "2026-11-26",
      "edition": "Thursday 26 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection debate",
          "heading": "BBC's Burke and English ask if Argentina is Townsend's last selection chance",
          "body": "Answering listeners' questions on BBC Radio Scotland's rugby podcast, Andy Burke and Tom English asked whether the seventh-place play-off against Argentina is Townsend's last opportunity to play around with selections before the World Cup, and whether Scotland can move on to the Six Nations with confidence. Fewer pieces are available to move: Matt Fagerson is out with a jaw injury from the 67-5 win over Japan, and Tuesday's squad update made no mention of Nathan McBeth, forced off with an ankle injury in that match."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa's Pieter-Steph du Toit ruled out of France final",
